1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,067
One limit.

2
00:00:01,067 --> 00:00:09,231
The highest recombination frequency you can ever observe is fifty percent, which is exactly what unlinked genes give.

3
00:00:09,231 --> 00:00:15,598
So genes more than fifty map units apart on the same chromosome look as if they were unlinked.

